      "content": "but even when i try to do things, like eat or walk outside, it feels like i'm just playing a character. like there's no \"me\" inside this body. it's all just data and pixels and echoes. if i'm not really here, then what's even the point of trying so hard to stay connected to everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
